usage: verify_v4_middle_withdrawal.py [-h] --mode {engineering,formal}
                                      --producer PRODUCER --output OUTPUT

Study047 independent continuous-stream, dictionary-physics verifier. Only
immutable source contracts are shared with the producer. This module never
imports a producer scientific function or treats a saved scientific value as
an oracle. Saved objects are compared after independent reconstruction.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mode {engineering,formal}
  --producer PRODUCER   existing read-only producer epoch
  --output OUTPUT       new exclusive verifier epoch
